1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
Due to poor communication,

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,800
life becomes very difficult.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,000
I will tell you

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,200
about one such case.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,500
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad,

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
I'm a psychologist.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,000
In my recent cases,

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,500
there was a boy.

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,000
He studied very well,

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
got great marks,

11
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,800
everything was perfect.

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,500
On record, he was excellent.

13
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,800
He was very good.

14
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,500
But when sitting to talk,

15
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,000
he feared English.

16
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,800
He feared speaking to others.

17
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,500
He feared going to coaching.

18
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,000
With all these fears,

19
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,500
he couldn't face interviews.

20
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,000
He went to interviews

21
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,800
and failed repeatedly.

22
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,500
Why is this happening?

23
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,200
Especially these days,

24
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,000
no one should fear English.

25
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Because you study in English.

26
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,800
Even then, why fear?

27
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,500
Why is he scared?

28
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,800
He magnifies the interviews.

29
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,800
He fears talking to anyone.

30
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:18,500
Why does this happen?

31
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,200
You have the knowledge,

32
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,800
but can't explain it.

33
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:26,800
So he failed many interviews.

34
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:30,000
Here is how to practice.

